description=Mount cloud storage locally using rclone & fusermount. Automatically downloads the latest BETA version during installation. Supports KernelSU webroot for web-based configuration. Virtually limitless storage expansion with support for dozens of cloud providers. Extremely useful for streaming large media files without need for full caching. Binaries obtained directly from beta.rclone.org.
